{"id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-valid-modal.md","title":"Modal Validity","display":"df-valid-modal — Modal Validity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-valid-modal","aliases":["89-df-valid-modal"],"display":"df-valid-modal — Modal Validity","depends_on":["[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-valid-modal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-valid-modal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-valid-modal — Modal Validity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span> is the\nwell-formed-frame predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{KModel}\\)</span> is the well-formed-model predicate from\n<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{F}\\models A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\forall V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal{P}(W)\\;\n\\forall w\\in W\\;((W,R,V),w\\models A),\\\\\n\\models A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall W,R,V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\n\\forall w\\in W\\;((W,R,V),w\\models A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{F}\\models A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\forall V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal{P}(W)\\;\n\\forall w\\in W\\;((W,R,V),w\\models A),\\\\\n\\models A\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall W,R,V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to\n\\forall w\\in W\\;((W,R,V),w\\models A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal{F} \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在框架<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>上有效</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models \\varphi\">\\(\\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>普遍有效（在所有框架上有效）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)$, and $\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)$ is the\nwell-formed-frame predicate from [[89-df-kripke-frame]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KModel}$ is the well-formed-model predicate from\n[[89-df-kripke-model]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KModel}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}valid\\text{-}modal}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{F}\\models A\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\land\n\\forall V:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathcal{P}(W)\\;\n\\forall w\\in W\\;((W,R,V),w\\models A),\\\\\n\\models A\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall W,R,V\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{KModel}(W,R,V)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\to\n\\forall w\\in W\\;((W,R,V),w\\models A)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F} \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1189,"backlinks":[{"id":"b390be190f300538","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"cf7dbabb97c0679f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：FMP关于有效性"},{"id":"50df0572bbd651eb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"3771cb3ddfd32097","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：扩张可能影响有效性"},{"id":"9c84d18273410b84","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"920317161a2cce71","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：在所有世界中真"},{"id":"774a7723667e1813","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]：全真公式有真值集 $W$"},{"id":"74c9df4215ffa321","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f9af10c36caa5628","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a9ff8bb34acb4c57","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"coun